    "updated_at": "2022-03-01T17:31:43Z",
    "body": "Obtain a storage key doesn't work on opaque origins.  I guess it would matter for non-storage APIs like broadcast channel using \"obtain a storage key for non-storage purposes\", though.  Maybe that algorithm can only operate on environment settings.  Seems like we need an environment version of \"obtain a storage key\", though.",
