    "created_at": "2022-03-01T17:32:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-01T17:32:57Z",
    "body": "Or we can write it as \"if an environment settings object, then use its origin.  Otherwise compute origin from the environment creation URL\".  That is what service worker client does today.",
