    "created_at": "2022-03-01T17:39:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-01T18:13:01Z",
    "body": "It sounds somewhat reasonable. https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#network-partition-keys does something similar (although it incorrectly says it takes an environment settings object, it's actually called with an environment at times and accounts for that).\r\n\r\nAnd yeah, there's a risk that the key changes with the eventual environment. That needs to be accounted for somehow.\r\n\r\n(The similarity suggests some eventual shared abstraction should perhaps be created in HTML.)",
